# AlHaitham Nahida Fischl Kirara. ~20s Rot. Long Field time Alhaitham Spread. Fischl alternate skill and burst during alhaitham's burst window. Kirara builds full hp and doesn't burst at all, though she has enough ER to do so. Nahida bursts nearly every rotation.

# Team - Options listed by DPS
alhaitham char lvl=90/90 cons=0 talent=9,9,9;
alhaitham add weapon="harbinger" refine=5 lvl=90/90;
alhaitham add set="gd" count=4;
alhaitham add stats hp=4780 atk=311 em=187 dendro%=0.466 cr=0.311; #main
alhaitham add stats def%=0.124 def=39.36 hp=507.88 hp%=0.0992 atk=33.08 atk%=0.0992 er=0.1102 em=79.28 cr=0.331 cd=0.7944; # HoD
